Masters are gone! No!

248
00:14:10,500 --> 00:14:12,260
I win the duel!

249
00:14:15,200 --> 00:14:16,580
You there, Joey?

250
00:14:22,020 --> 00:14:25,280
It's Joey! He's okay! But how?

251
00:14:25,840 --> 00:14:28,140
The dark magician survived!

252
00:14:30,080 --> 00:14:32,600
And so did the flame swordsman!

253
00:14:33,320 --> 00:14:34,150
Cheaters!

254
00:14:34,233 --> 00:14:36,380
How can your deckmasters be standing?

255
00:14:37,060 --> 00:14:38,380
Take a look, Lecter.

256
00:14:38,540 --> 00:14:41,020
I used my trusty silver dollar trap card.

257
00:14:41,460 --> 00:14:44,320
Explain yourself! All right. First,

258
00:14:44,540 --> 00:14:46,857
I saved Yu-Gi's Dark
Magician by forcing my

259
00:14:46,940 --> 00:14:49,557
Flamed Swordsman to take
the brunt of your attack.

260
00:14:49,640 --> 00:14:52,677
Then, my Trap Card kicked
in and saved my Swordsman.

261
00:14:52,760 --> 00:14:54,819
That card only saves weak monsters.

262
00:14:55,600 --> 00:14:56,430
Of course!

263
00:14:56,660 --> 00:14:58,897
Joey weakened his
Swordsman when he used its

264
00:14:58,980 --> 00:15:01,745
special ability to power
up his Rocket Warrior.

265
00:15:02,840 --> 00:15:04,820
So when Lecter's Dragon attacked,

266
00:15:05,060 --> 00:15:08,900
Joey's Silver Dollar Trap Card
saved his already weak Swordsman.

267
00:15:10,520 --> 00:15:12,537
That was an excellent move, Joey.

268
00:15:12,620 --> 00:15:14,820
Joey, you managed to save us both.

269
00:15:15,780 --> 00:15:17,877
Well, you'd have done the same thing.

270
00:15:17,960 --> 00:15:20,080
So, what do you think about that?

271
00:15:20,320 --> 00:15:23,920
Look, kid, I'm not through
with you by a long shot.

272
00:15:24,180 --> 00:15:26,440
And neither is my dragon.

273
00:15:26,800 --> 00:15:29,660
So prepare to lose your bodies.

274
00:15:33,720 --> 00:15:36,680
My dragon gets weaker with every turn.

275
00:15:37,240 --> 00:15:39,820
Joey, did you see that? You bet.

276
00:15:40,100 --> 00:15:42,017
His dragon just lost the dag points.

277
00:15:42,100 --> 00:15:44,360
Just in time for my turn.

278
00:15:46,080 --> 00:15:48,100
Check out this move, Lecter.

279
00:15:48,360 --> 00:15:50,180
Reveal my face-down card.

280
00:15:50,560 --> 00:15:51,600
Knight's title.

281
00:15:51,960 --> 00:15:55,380
Now I'll add this magic
card to Yugi's Deckmaster.

282
00:16:00,340 --> 00:16:04,320
It transforms Dark Magician
into Dark Magician Knight.

283
00:16:06,420 --> 00:16:09,337
Now, thanks to my
Deckmaster's special power,

284
00:16:09,420 --> 00:16:12,580
I can transfer most of its
attack points to Yu-Gi's.

285
00:16:13,440 --> 00:16:18,220
Since this power only works on warriors,
I had to transform Dark Magician first.

286
00:16:19,320 --> 00:16:21,520
3,200 attack points!

287
00:16:21,660 --> 00:16:24,440
That makes it stronger
than my Berserk Dragon!

288
00:16:25,000 --> 00:16:26,471
That should do the trick.

289
00:16:26,620 --> 00:16:28,877
Now why don't you do the honors, Yu-Gi?

290
00:16:28,960 --> 00:16:30,300
With pleasure, Joey.

291
00:16:30,980 --> 00:16:32,340
I end my turn.

292
00:16:32,520 --> 00:16:34,220
We make a great team, Joey.

293
00:16:34,720 --> 00:16:37,437
Together, you and I are
about to topple the Big Five.

294
00:16:37,520 --> 00:16:39,900
I demand an explanation, Johnson.

295
00:16:40,160 --> 00:16:42,540
You said Wheeler would hold Yugi back.

296
00:16:42,680 --> 00:16:45,660
Instead, he's the reason
why they're ahead of us.

297
00:16:46,340 --> 00:16:48,640
Well, don't look at me.

298
00:16:48,880 --> 00:16:49,940
You five are done.

299
00:16:50,240 --> 00:16:51,200
My move.

300
00:16:51,860 --> 00:16:52,690
And now,

301
00:16:52,900 --> 00:16:58,600
Dark Magician Knight attack their berserk
dragon with Sword of Dark Magic attack!

302
00:17:00,620 --> 00:17:04,437
Carrying with him the combined
strength of both of our deckmasters,

303
00:17:04,520 --> 00:17:06,226
our knight cannot be stopped!

304
00:17:16,400 --> 00:17:19,697
There goes your Deckmaster That means all

305
00:17:19,780 --> 00:17:23,117
five of you automatically
lose this duel Now

306
00:17:23,200 --> 00:17:26,137
return Tristan's body as you promised And

307
00:17:26,220 --> 00:17:29,540
run back to Noah We've
all had enough of you

308
00:17:30,640 --> 00:17:34,257
It was a pleasure doing business
with you gentlemen Yugi and

309
00:17:34,340 --> 00:17:38,317
Joey crushed those five creeps I
knew they would Way to go, guys.

310
00:17:38,400 --> 00:17:42,097
Hey, Tristan, I guess your days
of looking like a chimp are over.

311
00:17:42,180 --> 00:17:45,260
Yeah, too bad I can't say
the same for you, Duke.

312
00:17:48,760 --> 00:17:53,040
Well, now it's time for you five
to give Tristan his body back.

313
00:17:53,500 --> 00:17:58,580
I'm afraid you've mistaken me for someone
who believes in playing fair. Say, what?

314
00:17:58,820 --> 00:18:00,380
All right, it's go time.

315
00:18:00,680 --> 00:18:01,840
As you wish.

316
00:18:05,720 --> 00:18:08,000
Now to take five more bodies.

317
00:18:13,120 --> 00:18:14,900
Hey, what's going on?

318
00:18:15,160 --> 00:18:17,860
Breaking my rules again, are we? Noah!

319
00:18:18,900 --> 00:18:21,724
You five fools have failed
me for the last time.

320
00:18:22,120 --> 00:18:23,160
What's happening?

321
00:18:25,940 --> 00:18:27,180
They disappeared.

322
00:18:27,920 --> 00:18:28,750
Oh, no.

323
00:18:28,920 --> 00:18:31,273
They took Tristan's body away with them.

324
00:18:31,840 --> 00:18:32,960
I don't believe it.

325
00:18:33,160 --> 00:18:36,572
I'll be stuck in this monkey
suit for the rest of my life.

326
00:18:37,900 --> 00:18:42,860
And I'm feeling more like a monkey and
less like me every second. This stinks.

327
00:18:46,280 --> 00:18:48,020
I'm here for you, Tristan.

328
00:18:48,860 --> 00:18:51,566
Second thought, I can
learn to live with this.

329
00:18:55,020 --> 00:18:56,040
Master Noah.

330
00:18:56,400 --> 00:18:58,480
The five of you are pathetic.

331
00:18:59,240 --> 00:19:00,360
Right, Mokuba?

332
00:19:01,220 --> 00:19:04,037
I hired you to defeat
Seto and his friends.

333
00:19:04,120 --> 00:19:05,760
Give us another chance.

334
00:19:06,100 --> 00:19:07,924
We'll put them out of business.

335
00:19:08,080 --> 00:19:09,668
Too late for that, Gansley.

336
00:19:10,280 --> 00:19:11,980
Please, Noah, help us.

337
00:19:12,240 --> 00:19:14,577
We need these bodies to escape.

338
00:19:14,660 --> 00:19:18,601
We've been stuck in this virtual
abyss for what seems like forever.

339
00:19:18,900 --> 00:19:20,040
You can save us.

340
00:19:20,360 --> 00:19:23,889
Give us those bodies and we'll
help you take over, Kaivakor.

341
00:19:25,560 --> 00:19:26,777
You help me.

342
00:19:26,860 --> 00:19:30,380
I'd be better off with five
baboons than you fools.

343
00:19:30,920 --> 00:19:33,038
It's time for you to leave for good.

344
00:19:33,200 --> 00:19:34,030
Is that clear?

345
00:19:34,180 --> 00:19:35,420
Leave for good?

346
00:19:35,600 --> 00:19:37,120
Please reconsider, sir.

347
00:19:37,380 --> 00:19:38,920
As my father would say,

348
00:19:39,120 --> 00:19:43,500
your work is unacceptable and
therefore you must be eliminated now.

349
00:19:46,080 --> 00:19:50,680
I think I'll imprison each of you in a
different corner of my work. Forever.

350
00:19:51,760 --> 00:19:52,590
Whoa!

351
00:19:53,980 --> 00:19:56,500
Now it's time I challenge Seto personally.

352
00:19:58,900 --> 00:20:03,440
I'll prove once and for all that I'm
the true heir to the Kaiba Empire!
